## 12. `ui.js` — the menu

Markup: `#menu` > `#menu-backdrop` + `.menu__panel`, panel holding a `#menu-close` button (20×20 X icon, two paths `M18 6 6 18` and `m6 6 12 12`, label "Close"), a `.menu__nav` of five `.menu__link`s, and a `.menu__foot`.

